sequenceDiagram

  participant 3 as SAP System<br />[Software System]
  participant 46 as SAP API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3020]
  participant 62 as ASM Storage API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3000]
  participant 7 as Cloud Storage<br />[Software System]
  participant 6 as Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL<br />[Software System]

  3->>46: Sends PUT or multipart POST /api/sap<br />[HTTPS, Basic Auth or certificate]
  46->>62: Writes the component with the trusted internal key<br />[HTTP/REST, X-Api-Key]
  62->>7: Stores the binary and manifest<br />[GCS API over HTTPS]
  46->>6: Persists the SAP system/repository/document hierarchy<br />[PostgreSQL on 127.0.0.1:5432]